  "bound": "For eta<=B and L>max(nu,0), delta=exp(B-L)<=1, write d_eta^k q=sum_j a_j q^j. The absolute tail is at most [sum_j |a_j| delta^(j-1)] delta L^nu/[1-max(nu,0)/L].",
